AW2 beat and downbeat model (Auto-warp)

The beat model of Auto-warp (ReBuzz/Core/Clips/BeatModelData.cs, read by BeatModelNet.cs: 0.18 million
numbers, no audio) was FITTED ON the data below, in CI, by tools/aw2/train.py (fixed seed). Every file's
licence was checked when it was fetched (tools/aw2/fetch.py, fetch_slakh.py) and only Creative Commons
Attribution (CC BY 4.0, CC BY 3.0) and CC0 material was used; NC, ND, SA and unlicensed material was
dropped. Changes: the recordings were turned into log-mel features (some also time-stretched, pitch-shifted
or remixed from stems, with their labels mapped), and a small neural network was fitted to find the beats
and downbeats; only that network's coefficients are part of this software. The authors of the data do not
endorse this software. The validation and test items named in docs/specs/neo-audio.md section 17 were not used for fitting.

  The Groove MIDI Dataset v1.0.0 (Gillick, Roberts, Engel, Eck, Bamman; Magenta, Google; ICML 2019)
    https://magenta.tensorflow.org/datasets/groove    CC BY 4.0   (all drummers but 5 and 9, who are held out)
  GuitarSet (Xi, Bittner, Pauwels, Ye, Bello; ISMIR 2018)
    https://zenodo.org/records/3371780                CC BY 4.0   (players 00-03)
  Candombe beat and downbeat tracking dataset (Nunes, Rocamora, Jure, Biscainho)
    https://zenodo.org/records/6533068                CC BY 4.0
  AAM: Artificial Audio Multitracks Dataset (Ostermann, Vatolkin, Ebeling; EURASIP J. Audio Speech Music Process. 2023)
    https://zenodo.org/records/5794629                CC BY 4.0
  Slakh2100 (Manilow, Wichern, Seetharaman, Le Roux; WASPAA 2019), rendered from Lakh MIDI
    https://zenodo.org/records/4599666                CC BY 4.0
  Freesound Loop Dataset (Ramires, Font, Serra; ISMIR 2020), only the loops that are CC0 or CC BY 3.0
    https://zenodo.org/records/3967852                each loop's author and licence: FSL10K-ATTRIBUTION.txt
  Test signals generated by this repository's own code (ReBuzz.SessionTests/AutoWarp/WarpSignals.cs)   CC0

